From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] home: consolidate the HomeWindow chain

homewindow.py had the same problem on a smaller scale: 8 patches, 6 of them
single-file, with zero-context hunks. Replaying them produced a homewindow.py
that also failed to parse.

This patch is a single exact-context diff from the pinned baseline to the
homewindow.py the qualified preview is running.

Folded patches, in their original order:

  0010  
  0031  
  0085  gtk4: handle zoom keys on focused Home surface
  0086  gtk4: select Home view stack for zoom keys
  0088  gtk4: keep Home surface focusable for Sugar shortcuts
  0141  home: keep the character that summons the search entry

The homewindow.py hunks of 0027 and 0155 are folded in here too and were
removed from those patches, which keep their other files.
